# olim.uz frontend qoidalari

Frontend ustida ishlaganda:

1. Avval `.cursor/skills/impeccable/SKILL.md` Setup qadamlarini bajaring va product registerini yuklang.
2. Stack: Laravel + Inertia React, JSX, Tailwind CSS, Ant Design 6 va Tiptap. Eski Phoenix/Bootstrap, Feather, Lucide yoki Summernote patternlarini qaytarmang.
3. Tokenlar uchun `tailwind.config.js`, umumiy komponentlar uchun `resources/css/app.css` va `resources/js/Components` manba hisoblanadi.
4. Layout va responsive joylashuvda Tailwind, interaktiv UI (button, input, select, upload, switch, tabs, pagination, modal, alert, dropdown) uchun Ant Design komponentlaridan foydalaning.
5. Inertia navigatsiyasi va formalarida `Link`, `router` hamda `useForm` ishlating; ichki yo'nalishlarda oddiy `<a>` yoki qo'lda `fetch` yozmang.
6. Kontrast WCAG AA darajasida bo'lsin, fokus holati ko'rinsin, mobile sidebar/table ishlasin va harakatlar `prefers-reduced-motion`ni hurmat qilsin.
7. Nested card, gradient text, glassmorphism, dekorativ animatsiya, tasodifiy z-index, inline style va generated `public/build` fayllarini qo'lda tahrirlashdan saqlaning.
